# text_lzh = 善男子！汝不應修一善、照一法、行一行、發一願、得一記、住一忍，生究竟想；不應以限量心，行於六度，住於十地，淨佛國土，事善知識。
# text_en = Son of Good Family, you should not cultivate only one type of goodness, illuminate only one dharma, practice only one practice, make only one vow, receive only one prediction, and dwell in only one type of patience and think you have achieved the ultimate; You should not rely on a limited resolve to practice the six perfections, dwell on the ten grounds, purify the buddha lands and serve one’s good spiritual guides.
