# text_lzh = 具足一切菩薩陀羅尼辯才門，得一切菩薩清淨藏，生一切菩薩定光明，得一切菩薩殊勝願，與一切菩薩同一願，聞一切菩薩殊勝法，
# text_en = Completely fulfills all bodhisattvas’ dhāraṇī and eloquence gateways; Acquires all bodhisattvas’ treasury of purity; Produces all bodhisattvas’ light of meditative absorptions; Acquires all bodhisattvas’ especially excellent vows; Shares the same single vow with all bodhisattvas; Listens to all bodhisattvas’ especially excellent Dharma;
