# text_lzh = 是於一念中而知一切三世者之所住處；是於一念中往詣一切國土者之所住處；是于一切衆生前悉現其身者之所住處；是心常利益一切世間者之所住處；
# text_en = Is the abode of those who, in but a single mind-moment, know all three periods of time; Is the abode of those who, in but a single mind-moment, travel to all lands to pay their respects; Is the abode of those who manifest their bodies directly before all beings; Is the abode of those whose minds always benefit everyone in the entire world;
