# text_lzh = 是能遍至一切處者之所住處；是雖已出一切世間，爲化衆生故而恒於中現身者之所住處；是不著一切刹，爲供養諸佛故而遊一切刹者之所住處；
# text_en = Is the abode of those who are able to go forth everywhere to all places; Is the abode of those who, even though they have already transcended everything in the entire world, still constantly manifest bodies within it in order to teach beings; Is the abode of those who are not attached to any kṣetra and yet travel to all kṣetras to make offerings to all buddhas;
