# text_lzh = 是能演說難遭遇法者之所住處；是能住難知法、甚深法、無二法、無相法、無對治法、無所得法、無戲論法者之所住處；是住大慈大悲者之所住處；
# text_en = Is the abode of those who are able to expound even on rarely encountered dharmas; Is the abode of those who are able to abide in recondite dharmas, extremely profound dharmas, non-dual dharmas, signless dharmas, non-counteractive dharmas, dharmas that cannot be found anywhere at all, and dharmas that are free of all conceptual proliferation; Is the abode of those who abide in the great kindness and the great compassion
