# sent_id = avatamsaka_sutra_0221
# text_lzh = 是雖住四禪而不隨禪生，雖行四無量爲化衆生故而不生色界，雖修四無色定以大悲故而不住無色界者之所住處；
# text_en = It is the abode of: Those who, although they abide in the four dhyānas, still do not take rebirth in accordance with the dhyānas; Those who, although they practice the four immeasurable minds for the purpose of teaching beings, still do not take rebirth in the form realm; and Those who, even though they cultivate the four formless concentrations, still, due to the great compassion, do not abide in the formless realm.
