# sent_id = avatamsaka_sutra_0231
# text_lzh = 爾時，善財童子而說頌言：「此是大悲清淨智，利益世間慈氏尊，灌頂地中佛長子，入如來境之住處。
# text_en = This is the abode of the one of great compassion and pure wisdom who benefits those in the world, the Venerable Maitreya, the Buddha’s senior son on the crown-anointing consecration ground who is on the verge of entering the realm of the Tathāgatas.
